ābājī Mahārāj"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":14,"first_line":"śrī-siddhānta-sarasvatīti vidito","author":"Śrīla Bhakti Rakṣak Śrīdhar Dev-Goswāmī Mahārāj"},"title":["Bhagavān Śrīla Bhakti Siddhānta Saraswatī Ṭhākur"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Rakṣak Śrīdhar Dev-Goswāmī Mahārāj"],"verses":[{"text":["śrī-siddhānta-sarasvatīti vidito","    gauḍīya-gurv-anvaye","bhāto bhānuriva prabhāta-gagane","    yo gaura-saṅkīrtanaiḥ","māyāvāda-timiṅgilodara-gatān","    uddhṛtya jīvanimān","kṛṣṇa-prema-sudhābdhi-gāhana-sukhaṁ","    prādāt prabhuṁ taṁ bhaje"],"translation":["“In the great Gauḍīya Vaiṣṇava teachers’ line,\\","as Śrīla Bhakti Siddhānta Saraswatī he’s renowned.\\","Like the radiant sun in the morning sky,\\","he appeared to rescue all souls swallowed by\\","the all-devouring impersonal philosophy.\\","By spreading the teachings of Lord Gaurāṅga\\","to sing the Holy Name of Lord Śrī Krishna,\\","he gave all the chance to dive in the ocean \\","of love of Śrī Krishna, the Supreme Person.\\","Śrīla Bhakti Siddhānta, my lord, divine master —\\","at his feet do I pray to serve him forever.”"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"image":{"src":"/images/resources/en/5.jpg","type":"image/jpeg","width":454,"height":543,"length":36605}},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/en-2022/shri-siddhanta-sarasvatiti-vidito/","description":"Bhagavān Śrīla Bhakti Siddhānta Saraswatī Ṭhākur — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Rakṣak Śrīdhar Dev-Goswāmī Mahārāj with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Bhagavān Śrīla Bhakti Siddhānta Saraswatī Ṭhākur. by Śrīla Bhakti Rakṣak Śrīdhar Dev-Goswāmī Mahārāj | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-2022","slug":"shri-siddhanta-sarasvatiti-vidito"}}